,"loyalty":"98","reputation":"1950","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005702","armor":"WP1009505","helmet":"WP1026405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1023","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[64,53,43,44,57,63],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"98","reputation":"1950","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005702","armor":"WP1009505","helmet":"WP1026405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ1000115","city":"CS1051","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[64,53,43,44,57,63],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"98","reputation":"1950","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005702","armor":"WP1009505","helmet":"WP1026405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1023","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[64,53,43,44,57,63],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"950","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005702","armor":"WP1009505","helmet":"WP1026405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1003","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[64,53,43,44,57,63],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"950","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005702","armor":"WP1009505","helmet":"WP1026405"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"曹魏汝南太守、都亭侯李通长子，官至平虏中郎将。父亲李通于建安年间去世后，李绪继承了父亲的部曲。建安二十四年，协助曹仁驻守樊城，参与了襄樊之战，在与关羽军的交锋中力战有功。战后，被封为亭侯。李绪育有一子李秉，官至秦州刺史；孙李重，官至太子中庶子；曾孙李式，官至江夏太守。江夏李氏一脉，由此在魏晋时期延续不衰。","tc":"曹魏汝南太守、都亭侯李通長子，官至平虜中郎將。父親李通于建安年間去世后，李緒繼承了父親的部曲。建安二十四年，協助曹仁駐守樊城，參與了襄樊之戰，在與關羽軍的交鋒中力戰有功。戰后，被封為亭侯。李緒育有一子李秉，官至秦州刺史；孫李重，官至太子中庶子；曾孫李式，官至江夏太守。江夏李氏一脈，由此在魏晉時期延續不衰。","en":"Eldest son of Cao Wei's Governor of Runan and Marquis of Duting, Li Tong, he rose to the rank of General of the Household Who Pacifies the Caitiffs. After his father Li Tong passed away during the Jian'an era, Li Xu inherited his father's Private Troops. In the twenty-fourth year of Jian'an, he assisted Cao Ren in defending Fan Castle and took part in the Battle of Xiangfan, fighting valiantly and rendering meritorious service in clashes with Guan Yu's army. After the battle, he was enfeoffed as a Marquis of a Village. Li Xu had a son, Li Bing, who rose to Inspector of Qin Province, a grandson, Li Zhong, who served as Cadet to the Crown Prince, and a great-grandson, Li Shi, who became Governor of Jiangxia. Through them, this Jiangxia Li lineage flourished continuously through the Wei and Jin dynasties.","jp":"曹魏の汝南太守・都亭侯である李通の長男。官位は平虜中郎将に至った。父の李通が建安年間に死去すると、その部曲を継承した。建安二十四年には曹仁を補佐して樊城を守備し、襄樊の戦いに参戦して関羽軍との交戦で奮戦し功績を挙げた。戦後、亭侯に封じられた。子の李秉は秦州刺史、孫の李重は太子中庶子、曾孫の李式は江夏太守に至り、江夏李氏の一門は魏晋の時代を通じて長く繁栄した。","kr":"조위의 여남태수이자 도정후인 이통의 장남으로, 관직은 평로중랑장에 이르렀습니다. 부친 이통이 건안 연간에 세상을 떠나자 부친의 부곡을 물려받았습니다. 건안 24년에는 번성을 수비하던 조인을 도와 양번 전투에 참전하였으며, 관우군과의 교전에서 분전하여 공을 세웠습니다. 전투가 끝난 후 정후에 봉해졌습니다. 아들 이병은 진주자사, 손자 이중은 태자중서자, 증손자 이식은 강하태수에 이르러, 강하 이씨 일문은 위진 시대에도 그 명맥을 면면히 이어 나갔습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1033815","remark":"普武","surname":"李","surnameTc":"李","surnameEn":"Li","surnameJp":"李","surnameKr":"이","surnameOther":"","name":"绪","nameTc":"緒","nameEn":"Xu","nameJp":"緒","nameKr":"서","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"李绪","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"217","city":"CS1023","gender":"0","rule":"64","force":"53","wise":"43","politics":"44","charm":"57","will":"63","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"6","wiseTalent":"4","politicsTalent":"4","charmTalent":"5","willTalent":"6","weaponMaster":"24/5